OL,3,ANepal cracks down on online abuse of
OL,4,Aflood survivors
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepal is cracking down on online abuse
OL,7,Fdirected at survivors of last month's
OL,8,Fdeadly floods, with Prime Minister
OL,9,FBalendra Shah warning that authorities
OL,10,Fwill "show no leniency" to people who
OL,11,F"belittle" those who are suffering.
OL,13,FSome have taken to social media to
OL,14,Fappeal for information about their
OL,15,Floved ones and to urge officials to
OL,16,Fstep up search efforts, only to be hit
OL,17,Fby hostile comments.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
