OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANepal cracks down on online abuse of
OL,4,Aflood survivors
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People who make unnecessary remarks,
OL,7,Fbelittle those in pain or seek to cause
OL,8,Fthem further suffering at this
OL,9,Fsensitive time are criminals," Shah
OL,10,Fwrote in a Facebook post.
OL,12,FNepali police say they are looking into
OL,13,Fwhere these comments have originated
OL,14,Ffrom to identify addresses and phone
OL,15,Fnumbers.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
